   "html": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Building and Background Trees</title>\n<script type=\"application/json\" id=\"sp-scheme\">\n{\n \"format\": \"sp-scheme-package\",\n \"spScheme\": \"2.0\",\n \"survey\": {\n  \"title\": \"Building and Background Trees\",\n  \"description\": \"Faithful replication with the original photographs: 18 photographs of isolated rural houses on or near the skyline, three in Norrland, northern Sweden, and three in the Ambroz Valley, Cáceres, Spain, each digitally edited into three versions that change only the height of the trees behind the building: A, vegetation does not exceed the eaves; B, vegetation exceeds 0% to 50% of the building's height; C, vegetation exceeds 100% of the building's height. Participants give gender, age, country of origin and educational background, the paper's four background topics, then see the 18 photographs one at a time in random order, as in the paper, and answer the paper's question How would you rate the integration of the building in this scene? on its 5-point scale from 1 = very bad to 5 = very good. Rebuilt from Garrido-Velarde, Montero-Parejo, Hernández-Blanco & García-Moruno (2018), Visual Analysis of the Height Ratio between Building and Background Vegetation. Two Rural Cases of Study: Spain and Sweden, Sustainability 10(8): 2593, with the photographs cropped from its Figure 3 and the question from Section 2.4 (CC BY 4.0). Image ids: s1A-s6C = scenario 1-6 and height-ratio level A-C of Figure 3 (scenarios 1-3 Swedish, 4-6 Spanish); answers are in integration, keyed by image id; each image's scenario, country and height-ratio level are stored in the page's original-study block. Analysis as in the paper: mean integration rating per photograph and per height-ratio level, and a 2 (respondent country) x 3 (height ratio, within subjects) ANOVA with Bonferroni pairwise tests and Cohen's d; the paper (76 university students, 44 in Spain and 32 in Sweden) found that in both countries level B, vegetation up to half the building's height above it, was rated best and integration was good or very good up to that level, while level C was rated lowest by the Swedish students and mid-scale by the Spanish students, and Swedish students gave higher ratings than Spanish students at levels A and B. Differences from the original study: (1) the paper showed the photographs in face-to-face interviews with a researcher present, in Spanish and English; here the survey is online, in English, and anyone can take part; (2) the wording of the background questions and the instruction text are ours, because the paper lists only their topics; (3) the photographs are the figure copies (about 950-1040 px wide).\",\n  \"locale\": \"en\",\n  \"mediaFolders\": [\n   \"scenes\"\n  ],\n  \"pages\": [\n   {\n    \"name\": \"start\",\n    \"elements\": [\n     {\n      \"type\": \"consent\",\n      \"name\": \"consent\",\n      \"title\": \"I agree to take part. Participation is voluntary and my answers are recorded anonymously for research.\",\n      \"isRequired\": true,\n      \"labelTrue\": \"I agree\",\n      \"labelFalse\": \"I do not agree\"\n     }\n    ]\n   },\n   {\n    \"name\": \"about\",\n    \"elements\": [\n     {\n      \"type\": \"radiogroup\",\n      \"name\": \"gender\",\n      \"title\": \"Gender\",\n      \"isRequired\": true,\n      \"choices\": [\n       {\n        \"value\": \"male\",\n        \"text\": \"Male\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"female\",\n        \"text\": \"Female\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"other\",\n        \"text\": \"Other / prefer not to say\"\n       }\n      ]\n     },\n     {\n      \"type\": \"radiogroup\",\n      \"name\": \"age\",\n      \"title\": \"Age\",\n      \"isRequired\": true,\n      \"choices\": [\n       {\n        \"value\": \"under_26\",\n        \"text\": \"Under 26\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"26_40\",\n        \"text\": \"26-40\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"41_60\",\n        \"text\": \"41-60\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"over_60\",\n        \"text\": \"Over 60\"\n       }\n      ]\n     },\n     {\n      \"type\": \"text\",\n      \"name\": \"country\",\n      \"title\": \"Country of origin\",\n      \"isRequired\": true\n     },\n     {\n      \"type\": \"radiogroup\",\n      \"name\": \"education\",\n      \"title\": \"Educational background\",\n      \"isRequired\": true,\n      \"choices\": [\n       {\n        \"value\": \"secondary\",\n        \"text\": \"Secondary school or below\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"university_student\",\n        \"text\": \"University student\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"university_degree\",\n        \"text\": \"University degree\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"postgraduate\",\n        \"text\": \"Postgraduate degree\"\n       }\n      ]\n     }\n    ]\n   },\n   {\n    \"name\": \"photos\",\n    \"elements\": [\n     {\n      \"type\": \"rating\",\n      \"name\": \"integration\",\n      \"title\": \"How would you rate the integration of the building in this scene?\",\n      \"isRequired\": true,\n      \"rateMin\": 1,\n      \"rateMax\": 5,\n      \"minRateDescription\": \"Very bad\",\n      \"maxRateDescription\": \"Very good\",\n      \"description\": \"Keyed by image id.\"\n     }\n    ]\n   }\n  ]\n }\n}\n</script>\n<script type=\"application/json\" id=\"hr-original\">{\"source\": \"Garrido-Velarde, Montero-Parejo, Hernández-Blanco & García-Moruno (2018) Sustainability 10: 2593\", \"n\": {\"Spain\": 44, \"Sweden\": 32}, \"images\": [\"s1A\", \"s1B\", \"s1C\", \"s2A\", \"s2B\", \"s2C\", \"s3A\", \"s3B\", \"s3C\", \"s4A\", \"s4B\", \"s4C\", \"s5A\", \"s5B\", \"s5C\", \"s6A\", \"s6B\", \"s6C\"], \"classes\": {\"s1A\": {\"scenario\": 1, \"country\": \"Sweden\", \"height_ratio\": \"A\", \"level\": \"vegetation does not exceed the height of the building's eaves\"}, \"s1B\": {\"scenario\": 1, \"country\": \"Sweden\", \"height_ratio\": \"B\", \"level\": \"vegetation exceeds 0% to 50% of the building's height\"}, \"s1C\": {\"scenario\": 1, \"country\": \"Sweden\", \"height_ratio\": \"C\", \"level\": \"vegetation exceeds 100% of the building's height\"}, \"s2A\": {\"scenario\": 2, \"country\": \"Sweden\", \"height_ratio\": \"A\", \"level\": \"vegetation does not exceed the height of the building's eaves\"}, \"s2B\": {\"scenario\": 2, \"country\": \"Sweden\", \"height_ratio\": \"B\", \"level\": \"vegetation exceeds 0% to 50% of the building's height\"}, \"s2C\": {\"scenario\": 2, \"country\": \"Sweden\", \"height_ratio\": \"C\", \"level\": \"vegetation exceeds 100% of the building's height\"}, \"s3A\": {\"scenario\": 3, \"country\": \"Sweden\", \"height_ratio\": \"A\", \"level\": \"vegetation does not exceed the height of the building's eaves\"}, \"s3B\": {\"scenario\": 3, \"country\": \"Sweden\", \"height_ratio\": \"B\", \"level\": \"vegetation exceeds 0% to 50% of the building's height\"}, \"s3C\": {\"scenario\": 3, \"country\": \"Sweden\", \"height_ratio\": \"C\", \"level\": \"vegetation exceeds 100% of the building's height\"}, \"s4A\": {\"scenario\": 4, \"country\": \"Spain\", \"height_ratio\": \"A\", \"level\": \"vegetation does not exceed the height of the building's eaves\"}, \"s4B\": {\"scenario\": 4, \"country\": \"Spain\", \"height_ratio\": \"B\", \"level\": \"vegetation exceeds 0% to 50% of the building's height\"}, \"s4C\": {\"scenario\": 4, \"country\": \"Spain\", \"height_ratio\": \"C\", \"level\": \"vegetation exceeds 100% of the building's height\"}, \"s5A\": {\"scenario\": 5, \"country\": \"Spain\", \"height_ratio\": \"A\", \"level\": \"vegetation does not exceed the height of the building's eaves\"}, \"s5B\": {\"scenario\": 5, \"country\": \"Spain\", \"height_ratio\": \"B\", \"level\": \"vegetation exceeds 0% to 50% of the building's height\"}, \"s5C\": {\"scenario\": 5, \"country\": \"Spain\", \"height_ratio\": \"C\", \"level\": \"vegetation exceeds 100% of the building's height\"}, \"s6A\": {\"scenario\": 6, \"country\": \"Spain\", \"height_ratio\": \"A\", \"level\": \"vegetation does not exceed the height of the building's eaves\"}, \"s6B\": {\"scenario\": 6, \"country\": \"Spain\", \"height_ratio\": \"B\", \"level\": \"vegetation exceeds 0% to 50% of the building's height\"}, \"s6C\": {\"scenario\": 6, \"country\": \"Spain\", \"height_ratio\": \"C\", \"level\": \"vegetation exceeds 100% of the building's height\"}}}</script>\n<style>\n:root{--bg:#f3f1ee;--card:#fff;--ink:#21201c;--muted:#5f5b53;--accent:#4f6b2c;--line:#ddd8d0;--warn:#b3261e;--sel:#e6eedb}\n*{box-sizing:border-box}html,body{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);font:17px/1.5 system-ui,-apple-system,\"Segoe UI\",Roboto,sans-serif}\nmain{max-width:900px;margin:0 auto;padding:22px 16px 40px}\nh1{font-size:1.5rem;margin:0 0 8px}h2{font-size:1.08rem;margin:0 0 4px}p{margin:0 0 12px;color:var(--muted)}\n.card{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;padding:16px 18px;margin-top:14px}\n.btn{appearance:none;border:0;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 20px;font:inherit;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;background:var(--accent);color:#fff}\n.btn:disabled{opacity:.35;cursor:not-allowed}\n.prog{font-size:.88rem;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:8px}\n.prompt{font-size:.92rem;color:var(--muted);margin:6px 0 0;text-align:center}\n.scene{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:3;background:var(--bg);padding-bottom:6px}\n.scene img{max-width:100%;max-height:52vh;width:auto;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto;border-radius:10px}\n@media (max-height:700px),(max-width:600px){.scene{position:static}}\n.it{padding:10px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}\n.it .st{font-weight:600;margin-bottom:6px;font-size:.96rem}\n.it .o{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(5,minmax(0,1fr));gap:4px}\n.it label{display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;text-align:center;gap:4px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;padding:7px 4px;cursor:pointer;font-size:.84rem;line-height:1.25}\n.it label:has(input:checked){background:var(--sel);border-color:var(--accent)}\n.it label input{display:none}.it .an{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:.74rem;color:var(--muted);margin-top:3px}@media (max-width:480px){.it .o{gap:3px}.it label{padding:9px 0;font-size:.86rem}}\n.it .an{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:.74rem;color:var(--muted);margin-top:3px}\n.it.miss .o,.q.miss{outline:2px solid var(--warn);outline-offset:2px;border-radius:8px}\n.q{margin-top:16px}.q:first-child{margin-top:0}\nlabel.opt{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;padding:8px 12px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;margin-top:6px;cursor:pointer}\ninput[type=text]{font:inherit;padding:8px 10px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;width:100%;max-width:420px;margin-top:6px}\n.err{color:var(--warn);margin-top:8px;min-height:1.2em}\n.credit{max-width:900px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 16px 24px;font-size:.78rem;color:var(--muted)}\n.ch label{justify-content:flex-start;text-align:left;padding:9px 12px;font-size:.9rem}\n.ch .o{grid-template-columns:1fr}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main id=\"app\" aria-live=\"polite\"><p>Loading…</p></main>\n<footer class=\"credit\">Photographs and question: Garrido-Velarde, Montero-Parejo, Hernández-Blanco &amp; García-Moruno (2018), Sustainability 10(8): 2593, Figure 3 and Section 2.4 (doi:10.3390/su10082593, CC BY 4.0).</footer>\n<script>\n(function(){\n  var KEY='height-ratio:state';\n  var ORIG=JSON.parse(document.getElementById('hr-original').textContent), ALL=ORIG.images;\n  var app=document.getElementById('app'), Q={}, files={}, st=null;\n  function esc(s){return String(s==null?'':s).replace(/[&<>\"]/g,function(c){return {'&':'&amp;','<':'&lt;','>':'&gt;','\"':'&quot;'}[c];});}\n  function err(m){var e=app.querySelector('.err');if(e)e.textContent=m||'';}\n  function ok(r){return !(r&&r.ok===false);}\n  function save(){try{localStorage.setItem(KEY,JSON.stringify(st));}catch(e){}}\n  function send(list,b,next){if(b)b.disabled=true;Promise.all(list).then(function(rs){var bad=rs.filter(function(r){return !ok(r);})[0];if(bad){if(b)b.disabled=false;return err(bad.error);}next();});}\n  function shuffle(a){a=a.slice();for(var i=a.length-1;i>0;i--){var j=Math.floor(Math.random()*(i+1)),t=a[i];a[i]=a[j];a[j]=t;}return a;}\n  function fresh(){return {step:'intro',order:shuffle(ALL),k:0};}\n  function chs(q){return (q.choices||[]).map(function(c){return typeof c==='string'?{value:c,text:c}:c;});}\n  function radios(n){return '<div class=\"q\" data-q=\"'+n+'\"><b>'+esc(Q[n].title)+'</b>'+chs(Q[n]).map(function(c){return '<label class=\"opt\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"'+n+'\" value=\"'+esc(c.value)+'\"> '+esc(c.text)+'</label>';}).join('')+'</div>';}\n  function intro(){\n    app.innerHTML='<h1>Buildings in the rural landscape</h1><p>You will see 18 photographs of houses in the countryside, one at a time. For each photograph, rate how well the building is integrated into the scene, from 1 (very bad) to 5 (very good). It takes about 4 minutes.</p>'+\n     '<div class=\"card\"><label class=\"opt\" style=\"margin-top:0\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"ok\"> '+esc(Q.consent.title)+'</label><div style=\"margin-top:16px\"><button class=\"btn\" id=\"go\">Start</button></div><div class=\"err\"></div></div>';\n    document.getElementById('go').onclick=function(){if(!document.getElementById('ok').checked)return err('Consent is needed to continue.');\n      send([SPSite.answer('consent',true)],this,function(){st.step='about';save();route();});};\n  }\n  function about(){\n    app.innerHTML='<h2>About you</h2><div class=\"card\">'+radios('gender')+'<div style=\"margin-top:16px\"></div>'+radios('age')+'<div style=\"margin-top:16px\"></div>'+'<div class=\"q\"><b>'+esc(Q.country.title)+'</b><br><input type=\"text\" id=\"cty\" maxlength=\"80\"></div><div style=\"margin-top:16px\"></div>'+radios('education')+\n      '<div style=\"margin-top:16px\"><button class=\"btn\" id=\"go\">Continue</button></div><div class=\"err\"></div></div>';\n    document.getElementById('go').onclick=function(){var v={};\n      for(var n of ['gender','age','education']){var x=app.querySelector('input[name='+n+']:checked');if(!x)return err('Please answer: '+Q[n].title);v[n]=x.value;}\n      var cty=document.getElementById('cty').value.trim();if(!cty)return err('Please answer: '+Q.country.title);\n      send([SPSite.answer('gender',v.gender),SPSite.answer('age',v.age),SPSite.answer('country',cty),SPSite.answer('education',v.education)],this,function(){st.step='photo';st.k=0;save();route();});};\n  }\n  function photo(){\n    if(st.k>=st.order.length){st.step='done';save();return route();}\n    var id=st.order[st.k],f=files[id],q=Q.integration;\n    app.innerHTML='<div class=\"prog\">Photograph '+(st.k+1)+' of '+st.order.length+'</div><div class=\"scene\"><img alt=\"Photograph of a house in a rural landscape\" src=\"'+esc(f.url)+'\"></div>'+\n      '<div class=\"card\"><div class=\"it\" data-n=\"r\" style=\"border-top:0;padding-top:0\"><div class=\"st\">'+esc(q.title)+'</div><div class=\"o\">'+[1,2,3,4,5].map(function(v){return '<label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"r\" value=\"'+v+'\">'+v+'</label>';}).join('')+'</div><div class=\"an\"><span>1 '+esc(q.minRateDescription||'Very bad')+'</span><span>5 '+esc(q.maxRateDescription||'Very good')+'</span></div></div>'+'</div>'+\n      '<div style=\"margin-top:16px\"><button class=\"btn\" id=\"go\">'+(st.k<st.order.length-1?'Next photograph':'Finish')+'</button></div><div class=\"err\"></div>';\n    document.getElementById('go').onclick=function(){\n      var r=app.querySelector('input[name=r]:checked');\n      if(!r){app.querySelector('[data-n=r]').classList.add('miss');return err('Please choose a rating.');}\n      send([SPSite.answer('integration',Number(r.value),{key:id,shown:[f.name]})],this,function(){st.k++;save();route();});};\n  }\n  function finish(){\n    app.innerHTML='<h1>Thank you!</h1><div class=\"card\"><p id=\"fin\">Submitting…</p><div class=\"err\"></div></div>';\n    SPSite.complete().then(function(r){if(!ok(r)){err(r.error||'Some answers are missing.');setTimeout(function(){st.step='intro';save();route();},1800);}\n      else{try{localStorage.removeItem(KEY);}catch(e){}var s=document.getElementById('fin');if(s)s.textContent='Your answers are saved.';}});\n  }\n  app.addEventListener('change',function(e){var r=e.target.closest&&e.target.closest('.it');if(r){r.classList.remove('miss');if(!app.querySelector('.it.miss'))err('');}});\n  function route(){var s=st.step;window.scrollTo(0,0);if(s==='about')return about();if(s==='photo')return photo();if(s==='done')return finish();intro();}\n  SPSite.onReady(function(ctx){\n    ['consent','gender','age','country','education','integration'].forEach(function(n){Q[n]=SPSite.getQuestion(n)||{name:n};});\n    (SPSite.getMedia('scenes')||[]).forEach(function(f){files[f.name.replace(/\\.[^.]+$/,'')]=f;});\n    var need=ALL.filter(function(k){return !files[k];});\n    if(need.length){app.innerHTML='<h1>Images missing</h1><p>Upload '+esc(need.join(', '))+' (.jpg) to the media folder \"scenes\".</p>';return;}\n    try{st=JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem(KEY));}catch(e){st=null;}\n    var a=(ctx&&ctx.answers)||{};\n    if(!(st&&st.order)||a.consent!==true)st=fresh();\n    save();route();\n  });\n})();\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>\n",
